"""Extra content for the hand-written calculator pages (the ones not in build_calc_pages.NEW).

Same format as calc_content.EXTRA:
  example – (heading, intro, [(label, value), ...], conclusion)
  more    – [(heading, [paragraph, ...]) or (heading, [paragraph, ...], (header_tuple, rows)), ...]

calc_extend.py puts it on the pages, between <!-- guide-extra:start --> and
<!-- guide-extra:end -->, just above the FAQ. Worked examples follow the
formulas in assets/js/calculators/<slug>.js; inputs that are not defaults are
named in the intro.
"""

